[00:46.58] Stand I towards the pantheon of our deities
[00:54.43] Conjuration...
[00:56.55] Let the Mighty Ones, the rulers of the night and day,
[01:02.57] Hear my words
[01:10.68] Let my chanting light the candles of us
[01:14.68] That will forever burn
[01:30.83] Enlightened by the Moon, by her enchanting light
[01:37.27] The dark path of witchcraft that tread I
[01:43.55] Forever burning flames of your wisdom in my heart
[01:49.68] In the rotten kingdoms as I agonize
[01:53.32] We are scattered but bright stars in the sky
[01:59.66] Us the arising wisdom of darkness typify
[02:05.95] By the silence of the night we cry
[02:12.21] For the sake of the Ancient Ones we shall die
[02:18.72] Forever burning flames of your wisdom in my heart
[02:24.98] In the rotten kingdoms as I agonize
[03:00.40] Here I am calling upon your holy names
[03:06.55] Cernunnos, the Horned one
[03:10.94] Aradia, my lady of the Moon
[03:13.24] Be present I pray thee
[03:19.30] Cernunnos, the Horned one
[03:22.37] Aradia, my lady of the Moon
[03:26.09] As my will, so mote it be!
[03:32.13] Cernunnos, the Horned one
[03:35.28] Aradia, my lady of the Moon
[03:52.76] When the lost temples rise again
[03:59.18] When the fading of so many million stars is paid for
[04:05.83] And when the majestic days of the past be with us
[04:12.25] I shall rest
[04:14.95] Forever in darkness...